import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { consultingUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
import '../styles/editorial.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our approach" description="The thinking behind Hyphos: connect knowledge to real work, make the reasoning visible and help experience travel beyond the person who holds it.">
<section class="product-editorial-hero page-shell"><p class="section-label">The thinking behind Hyphos</p><h1>The work gets better<br />when the knowledge<br />stays with it.</h1><p>Every organization depends on things its people know that never quite make it into the handbook.</p></section>
<section class="product-editorial-body page-shell"><aside class="product-editorial-aside"><p class="section-label">Hyphos Inc.</p><p>Founded by Daniel Newton.<br />Consulting, software and the knowledge that connects them.</p><a href={consultingUrl} class="text-link">Our consulting work ↗</a></aside><div class="product-editorial-prose"><h2>The reason matters as much as the record.</h2><p>A plan tells you what the team intends to do. It rarely tells you everything that led there: the exception, the conversation, the lesson from the last job.</p><p>Hyphos is built around keeping those connections useful. The documents, decisions and experience belong in the context of the work they inform.</p><h2>Experience should travel.</h2><p>People learn by working alongside someone who knows the craft. By seeing the reasoning, trying the work and getting a useful correction.</p><p>That is the idea behind apprenticeship in Hyphos. Make more of the thinking visible as the work happens, so the next person has something to build on.</p><h2>Start with something real.</h2><p>We're developing Hyphos with design partners. A pilot starts with a workflow, the people doing it and a clear problem to investigate.</p><p>The question is practical: can the team find the context, check the reasoning and continue the work with less reconstruction?</p><a href="/pricing" class="text-link">Explore a design partnership ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
